# ripgrep exclusions for generated artifacts.
#
# Broad source searches kept descending into generated single-line JSON and
# minified bundles, flooding worker terminals and burying the real call sites
# (PAPERCUTS, 3 hits). These paths hold machine-written data, never source you
# would grep for by hand.
#
# To search them anyway, pass `rg -u` (or `--no-ignore`) for one query. Note
# that an explicit `-g '<glob>'` also overrides these rules — ripgrep applies
# --glob with higher precedence than ignore files.

src/data/gen/*.json
src/assets/gen/*.json
dist/
*.min.*
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
